-- R6: Server-side code using service role keeps full access and sees every customer in support_customers
-- This is handled by the view creation logic below which includes all columns, 
-- but we need to ensure the view itself is accessible to service role for the app to work
-- Since service_role bypasses RLS, the view will be readable if we allow it or if the underlying tables are readable.
-- However, the requirement says "sees every customer in support_customers".
-- We will create the view and grant select on it to service_role explicitly if needed, 
-- but service_role bypasses RLS so it can read anything. 
